<title>AUSTRALIA: BankWest year net profit A$94.5 mln.</title>
<headline>BankWest year net profit A$94.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1996-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to February 28</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    150.1 vs  138.4</p>
<p>    Net					94.5 vs   99.2</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)		8.5 vs   n/a</p>
<p>NOTE: Bank of Western Australia Ltd is 51.47 percent owned by Bank of Scotland. It forecast a net profit of A$100.2 million for the year in its prospectus. Comparison is with 12 months to September 30, 1995.</p>
</text>
